{
  "name": "Daily Google Jobs digest in Google Sheets with Apify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ba0e25bf-e0ad-5f79-bc2c-2f4106acb424",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "0e983aab-3ed0-50cc-9814-f77a269f5042",
      "name": "Set the jobs to watch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "06487cde-ab98-5466-b763-8fc1dc052238",
              "name": "queries",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "[\"data engineer\", \"product manager\"]"
            },
            {
              "id": "f7fd149e-1a42-52a7-9770-30dc521fe1f7",
              "name": "country",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "US"
            },
            {
              "id": "637276b6-88f0-504a-bccf-a92e8e04d158",
              "name": "location",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Austin,Texas"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "844bb232-53ae-5c55-9ab8-849b87618222",
      "name": "Search Google Jobs",
      "type": "@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify",
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "memory": 256,
        "actorId": "hirepulse~google-jobs-scraper",
        "resource": "Actors",
        "operation": "Run actor and get dataset",
        "customBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ queries: $json.queries, country: $json.country, location: $json.location, max_jobs_per_query: 50 }) }}",
        "maxTotalChargeUsd": 1
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "970aa8d5-2d83-552a-abc6-d9ffd639565b",
      "name": "Keep real job records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        780,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c0bfac38-fe94-54c7-9b82-ec1a8830a0fa",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.title }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "73a1942f-676c-5d65-88d9-30bf493dbc7f",
      "name": "Shape today's rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1040,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One spreadsheet row per job, stamped with today's date.\nconst day = $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd');\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const j = item.json;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      Date: day,\n      Search: j.query,\n      Title: j.title,\n      Company: j.company,\n      Location: j.location ?? '',\n      Salary: j.salary ?? '',\n      'Salary min': j.salary_min ?? '',\n      'Salary max': j.salary_max ?? '',\n      Type: j.contract_type ?? '',\n      Posted: j.posted_ago ?? '',\n      'Listed on': j.source ?? '',\n      Apply: j.apply_url ?? '',\n    },\n  };\n});\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "66f68718-c31e-5979-8cb3-898938c88ed9",
      "name": "Append today's jobs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1300,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {},
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "075860dc-64a0-5f53-97a4-7dc83e99ec58",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 500,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Daily Google Jobs digest in Google Sheets\n\nEvery morning this workflow searches Google Jobs for the roles you list, in the city or country you choose, and appends one dated row per job to Google Sheets: title, company, location, salary, job type, posting age, the site it is listed on and the apply link.\n\nUseful for job seekers, recruiters and sales teams who sell to companies that are hiring.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Schedule** starts the run every day at 07:00.\n2. **Set the jobs to watch** holds your searches, country and city.\n3. **Apify** runs the [Google Jobs Scraper](https://apify.com/hirepulse/google-jobs-scraper) Actor and waits for the results.\n4. **Filter** keeps real job records.\n5. **Code** shapes one row per job with today's date.\n6. **Google Sheets** appends the rows.\n\n### Setup\n- Connect your Apify account in the Apify node.\n- Connect Google Sheets and pick a spreadsheet and sheet.\n\n### Cost\n$0.005 per search that finds jobs plus $0.001 per job. Two searches with 50 jobs each cost about $0.11 a day. Searches with no jobs are free. The Apify node caps each run at $1.\n\nOn the free Apify plan you get a preview: the first 10 jobs of the first search. A daily digest of several roles needs a **paid Apify plan**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7609bbbd-d69f-59de-8b47-b3649c36ac2f",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        200,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 220,
        "height": 140,
        "content": "### Your searches\nEdit the roles, the two-letter country code and the city (`City,Region`, or empty for the whole country)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ec8e8768-99ac-5240-bd5e-1e81819babb1",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1240,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "### Ideas\n- Send the rows to Slack or email instead of Sheets.\n- Add `employment_types: ['fulltime']` to the Apify input.\n- Combine with the [ATS Job Scraper](https://apify.com/hirepulse/ats-job-pulse) to track specific companies."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
